From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: chromium-blink-ios <noreply@github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] iOS extensions: prepare a verified package from the Store

Fetch the full CRX3 from the official updater with no cookies, bounded
bytes and an exact HTTPS redirect allowlist. Bind the verified package to
the requested Store ID, then reuse the signed Files import review.

---
